#: src/admin_trait.php:933
msgid ""
"If you wish to charge (or discount) visitors for using MyCryptoCheckout as "
"the payment gateway, you can enter the fixed or percentage amounts in the "
"boxes below. The cryptocurrency checkout price will be modified in "
"accordance with the combined values below. These are applied to the original"
" currency."
